{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 382, "line_no": 2, "text": "八音是布依族音乐中的奇葩，其旋律优美典雅，令人难忘。黔西南申报的八音已被", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 266, "w": 1467, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "八音是布依族音乐中的奇葩，其旋律优美典雅，令人难忘。黔西南申报的八音已被", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 266, "w": 1467, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 382, "line_no": 3, "text": "列入国家级非物质文化遗产名录。", "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 326, "w": 599, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "列入国家级非物质文化遗产名录。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 326, "w": 599, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 382, "line_no": 4, "text": "八音是一种器乐演奏的统称。因用八种乐器演奏得名。因演唱形式的不同，有广义", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 394, "w": 1463, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "八音是一种器乐演奏的统称。因用八种乐器演奏得名。因演唱形式的不同，有广义", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 394, "w": 1463, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 382, "line_no": 5, "text": "八音和狭义八音之分。", "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 459, "w": 390, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "八音和狭义八音之分。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 459, "w": 390, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 382, "line_no": 6, "text": "狭义八音，一般指布依戏的折子戏—布依板凳戏，也称八音坐弹（唱）。主要流行", "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 523, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "狭义八音，一般指布依戏的折子戏—布依板凳戏，也称八音坐弹（唱）。主要流行", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 523, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 382, "line_no": 7, "text": "于册亨、安龙、兴义等地。布依八音又叫“八音坐唱”，演出队伍8~14人不等，所唱生、", "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 583, "w": 1548, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "于册亨、安龙、兴义等地。布依八音又叫“八音坐唱”，演出队伍8~14人不等，所唱生、", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 583, "w": 1548, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 382, "line_no": 8, "text": "旦、净、丑诸戏曲，不化妆。因用牛腿骨、竹筒琴、直箫、月琴、三弦、芒锣、葫芦、短笛等8", "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 652, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "旦、净、丑诸戏曲，不化妆。因用牛腿骨、竹筒琴、直箫、月琴、三弦、芒锣、葫芦、短笛等8", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 652, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 382, "line_no": 9, "text": "种乐器合奏而得名。", "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 716, "w": 358, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "种乐器合奏而得名。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 716, "w": 358, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 382, "line_no": 10, "text": "“八音”常在民族节日、婚丧嫁娶、建房、祝寿等场合演奏，是深受布依族人民喜爱的", "bbox_px": {"x": 144, "y": 772, "w": 1472, "h": 68}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“八音”常在民族节日、婚丧嫁娶、建房、祝寿等场合演奏，是深受布依族人民喜爱的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 144, "y": 772, "w": 1472, "h": 68}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
